Step 2 of the build-up. Identical to virtualization-stacks-side-by-side-1.svg (see that prompt), with nothing
moved, plus the complete VMware Workstation box (box 3):

- Its two VMs, and below them its two VMM processes.
- Its own hypervisor: the vmmon kernel module on Linux, connected to the VMMs
  by short vertical lines.
- The subtitle "brings its own hypervisor" and the note "ESXi instead ships its
  own OS for bare metal".

Boxes 1 and 2 stay empty.
